                                                The vendor id and vendor api infix for the EthTrcv driver, if any. 
                                                This is used to include the correct header file and to point to the EthTrcv callbacks. 
                                                Example: 43_PHYGROUPB for a 43_PHYGROUPB driver or leave it blank to include EthTrcv.h
                                            </L-2>
                          </DESC>
